p":{"signed":5,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d28473e9366cfe5a6ac5e187ebbb27535bdde90ae61eb2192725ab13bb4205cc","event_uuid":"375d28fd-7e80-4a0b-b0d0-bc33720301c4","position":{"commit_sha":"d4f125590cb5ae11fcf55cc4cbe789697de235f6","position":"1794590362950282939-375d28fd-7e80-4a0b-b0d0-bc33720301c4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"7e50e1154185976cf1a9348778eeb1dc175fa54eb2505574bb72c5dcb7054122","event_uuid":"1f6df4f8-bef0-45d6-9206-4211e35e8288","position":{"commit_sha":"ff1de6604b616dc6dabcd5c016c38316c0cfbca5","position":"1794590550267703409-1f6df4f8-bef0-45d6-9206-4211e35e8288"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"78a6b3be45e26763db8ec6b5c0f0eb68db870710c8509107700609fe11112b16","event_uuid":"3f297120-0207-4ff3-8506-f1c1365464a4","position":{"commit_sha":"6e89415861e94bb4caeb3b7961b0dd1e0c79c8a9","position":"1794590871667521058-3f297120-0207-4ff3-8506-f1c1365464a4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0fe9ec800759834ebd28bc4d4f1a7ced39afe8de66762c82652e0e93f17d250a","event_uuid":"d745f6c5-d1ed-42da-ab0f-4f4c6ba43fda","position":{"commit_sha":"da696d9e55d97641b4ddda7f05f4bd54534345f9","position":"1794591252893771818-d745f6c5-d1ed-42da-ab0f-4f4c6ba43fda"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"2350fd9587a21604b890604a97f887ebadada971041e830fef5d10f98af9c33e","event_uuid":"58e51a97-3860-4388-b38d-f1e338a523a9","position":{"commit_sha":"da696d9e55d97641b4ddda7f05f4bd54534345f9","position":"1794591252919728618-58e51a97-3860-4388-b38d-f1e338a523a9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794590362950282939,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py` reads the change, refuses a stale `--revision`, then checks the `LLM-Review` and `Verified` labels with `_label_ok`, which needs the label's `approved` summary. Gerrit omits `approved` on a closed change, so re-running the script on a change that already merged reports a vote problem instead of the merge.\n\nObserved 2026-11-13 against change 3393 (MERGED, submitted 2026-11-13 04:09 PST, both votes +1 in `labels.*.all`), read-only:\n- `--revision aa1681bb531e3a607c7366cde951e263b51ba78f` (the merged revision): `refusing submit: missing live labels=['LLM-Review', 'Verified'], unresolved=0, submittable=False`, exit 3.\n- `--revision 0000…0000`: `refusing stale submit: inspected 0000…, current is aa1681bb…`, exit 2; correct and safe, but it does not say the change is merged.\n\nThe script's own reconcile path (Gerrit 3393's parent change, `5a4efd52a39`) already treats \"merged at the submitted revision\" as success (exit 0, says so). The pre-submit path should report the same state the same way rather than send the operator after votes that exist.\n\n## Approach\nIn `main`, right after `read_change()` and before the stale and label checks, branch on `detail[\"status\"]`:\n- `MERGED` and `--revision` equals the merged `current_revision`: print `change <n> is already merged at <sha>; nothing to submit` and return 0.\n- `MERGED` at a different revision: print that it is merged at `<current>`, not at the inspected revision, and return 2 (the stale-revision code).\n- `ABANDONED`: print that and return 3.\nNo POST of any kind on these paths (no hashtag, no submit). Update the module docstring's exit-code list. No new flag, config key or env var.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A MERGED change with the matching revision exits 0, prints `already merged`, and sends no POST.\n- [ ] A MERGED change with a different revision exits 2 and names both SHAs and `MERGED`, with no POST.\n- [ ] An ABANDONED change exits 3 and says abandoned, with no POST.\n- [ ] Open-change behavior is unchanged; proved by `pytest tests/unit/test_gerrit_submit_if_current_8b1c.py`.\n\n## Testing\nAdd RED cases to `tests/unit/test_gerrit_submit_if_current_8b1c.py` using its existing fake Gerrit, asserting exit code, message and that no POST was recorded. Then run the file, `make verify`, and a read-only live run against change 3393 with `--hashtag \"\"`.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py","reason":"report MERGED/ABANDONED state before the stale and vote checks"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gerrit_submit_if_current_8b1c.py","reason":"RED cases for merged/abandoned changes with no POST"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"d745f6c5-d1ed-42da-ab0f-4f4c6ba43fda","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1f9a-a161-bd35-404e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"gerrit_safe_submit.py reports \"missing live labels\" for an already-merged change","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["375d28fd-7e80-4a0b-b0d0-bc33720301c4","1f6df4f8-bef0-45d6-9206-4211e35e8288","3f297120-0207-4ff3-8506-f1c1365464a4","d745f6c5-d1ed-42da-ab0f-4f4c6ba43fda","58e51a97-3860-4388-b38d-f1e338a523a9"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794591252919728619,"uuid":"c1097d6f-65d8-4684-bbcc-0b479ed6eaab"}